    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76991" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰλίρ-ροος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
